  "description": "ASP.NET Core server integration for StingrayDbMasking: the backend HTTP API (MapStingrayDbMaskingApi) used by remote/WebAssembly UIs, and an optional standalone host for the UI pages (MapStingrayDbMaskingUi).",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
